#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut04_live
#! frames  300
#! poster  290
# --check: the plotted values depend on the host, not the compiler (the same pixels on CI with gfortran 14.3 and
# 16.2, none here; likely libm's results, by glibc version or CPU): on CI 2 pixel(s) over 2, measured
# 2026-11-12; 8 allowed, the threshold unchanged
#! check   max_failed=8
# tick "running", then raise the iterations per frame
0   move 500 300
5   move 38 59 20
30  down
32  up
120 move 59 85 20
145 down
147 move 200 85 30
180 up
195 move 700 300 30
